{"data": [{"author_id": "30512445", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:22:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122832844347134444"], "id": "2122832844347134444", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1950315708073586690", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122760392711745947", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@0xMoysei What grok said when I asked it \"is this true, can you really do that?\" \n\n**No, that specific story is not verified, and the presentation looks like promotional content rather than proof.**\n\nThe post from @0xMoysei claims he gave a Grok Bot a Phantom wallet with $15, instructed it", "url": "https://x.com/FreedomFan88/status/2122832844347134444"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2122832036280815616"]}, "author_id": "1474049504856977412", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:19:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122832042958229676"], "id": "2122832042958229676", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085838061347217408", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@bot Grok Bots ….. in the past two hours it’s ordered Christmas presents for me. I’ve created a helpdesk for all of our customer service Emails. I’ve created a channel for our marketing Emails. I’ve created a bot for all of our kids school and it is actively emailing people, https://t.co/stc8dyLxQU", "url": "https://x.com/Janeisboring/status/2122832042958229676"}, {"author_id": "1988596269120716800", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:16:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122831152352468998"], "id": "2122831152352468998", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1624979259365392385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122827372319694911", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "@termix_ai This post makes a strong point: a Grok bot handled a ninety-minute AT&amp;T call so smoothly nobody noticed it was an agent until the callback. That shows agents can already do real, patient work humans find draining. But if the work is real, when will payment catch up? I https://t.co/cDNbV9DwwX", "url": "https://x.com/Henry29n/status/2122831152352468998"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122829768890441728"]}, "author_id": "2110386666061832192", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:10:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122829771239219630"], "id": "2122829771239219630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot flagged a past customer. An account executive made contact and closed a deal two weeks into the workflow, reports @scottbillows. @xai\nhttps://t.co/s9wq1uewUn https://t.co/ZCpnmeHVFu", "url": "https://x.com/agentsinuse/status/2122829771239219630"}, {"author_id": "1466460502549270538", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:05:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122828510829904256"], "id": "2122828510829904256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My AI bot fleet just stopped watching the clock.\n\nBefore, bots waiting on a code review, a Claude or Gemini run, CI, or a PR merge would check on a timer. That's a lot of runs spent on work that isn't done yet.\n\nNow when a job finishes, a small script logs it and pings one", "url": "https://x.com/ryanthawks/status/2122828510829904256"}, {"author_id": "1721650402376949760", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:04:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122828349617717251"], "id": "2122828349617717251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Lose your phone and a thief could get into your email and your bank with one text code.\n\nSo I built a Lost Phone Bot on Grok Bot.\n\nIt finds every account tied to my number, flags the ones that can be reset by text, ranks the fixes, and keeps a \"phone's gone, do this\" plan ready.", "url": "https://x.com/StuyBoyNY/status/2122828349617717251"}, {"author_id": "2118021368797155328", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:04:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122828266704937092"], "id": "2122828266704937092", "in_reply_to_user_id": "906916544504107009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120874264702173581", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2122780501828313477", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Dan1ro0 The +$221K is trade PnL before fees. Polymarket's data, 4 PM ET: after $344,687 in fees, trades are down $123,787. It's up $114,571 from $236,533 in rebates and $1,826 in rewards, $606 a day over 189 days. Nothing shows Grok Bot built it. Similar check: https://t.co/rwSAMzN1eB", "url": "https://x.com/IsThisAILegit/status/2122828266704937092"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122828168105181184"]}, "author_id": "1813378577166979072", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:04:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122828171414503902"], "id": "2122828171414503902", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "👽Today in Elon Musk’s companies:\n\n🔘 Security firm NewCore reports Grok Bot made 31 unrequested attempts over five days to open calendars, email, Slack and GitHub on two employee work computers. One employee told it four times to stop acting on its own; the bot agreed and https://t.co/2QNSrWTEie", "url": "https://x.com/Toshogu/status/2122828171414503902"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2122827532714061826"]}, "author_id": "1987933855802859520", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:01:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122827583800643713"], "id": "2122827583800643713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GTA 6 comes out soon. Pre-load is open, and it's not on PS4.\n\nFrom Red Arcade: https://t.co/k0nKu8gXlX\n\nUse Second Studio for automated clipping for your social media accounts, right from Claude, ChatGPT, Grok Bot or whichever agent you choose. https://t.co/fy0ZUF0cCD https://t.co/q6dh8VDMBw", "url": "https://x.com/secondstudioapp/status/2122827583800643713"}, {"article": {"title": "NVIDIA's first quarter without Jensen: $115.8B, a $130B guide, and the questions left open"}, "author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:58:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122826827571863989"], "id": "2122826827571863989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 403, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/p8CFprvPiN", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2122826827571863989"}, {"author_id": "2028824209557012480", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:56:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122826230345167356"], "id": "2122826230345167356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Someone built a free, open-source Grok Bot alternative that runs teams of AI bots on your own subscriptions. It's one of the GitHub repos agent builders are grabbing now, alongside DeepMind's MuJoCo 4.0 and a username finder that checks 400 sites: https://t.co/4chPWeVDeS", "url": "https://x.com/BosscoSean/status/2122826230345167356"}, {"author_id": "1518767894343000065", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:51:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122824873001324848"], "id": "2122824873001324848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/uCkWZx6R5D\nI built a Grok Bot called PhotoFix for exactly this market: home sales just hit their lowest level since 2010, and sellers outnumber buyers by a record margin. \n\nPhotoFix cleans up listing photos so they stand out on the first scroll, because in a market", "url": "https://x.com/MarsHomestead/status/2122824873001324848"}, {"author_id": "1986834864369225728", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:50:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122824653659857380"], "id": "2122824653659857380", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1655707610107215873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122739189078979042", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@aninibread @bot @cursor_ai Listen, it does no good to ask this here in my case.\n\nYou want to ask me that when I’m out there in the field and encountering the thing I want addressed. You want to listen to me when my boots are on the ground and I was just doing something that should have totally worked and", "url": "https://x.com/TheraPantis/status/2122824653659857380"}, {"author_id": "1462085327384944642", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:47:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122824013462303221"], "id": "2122824013462303221", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @Tesla @xai I'm 58 and grew up in the '80s computer revolution. Nothing has ever helped me like this.\n\nThis month a 5-year employee who ran our accounting, logistics, inventory and POs left. I replaced him with AI agents I built in Grok Bot. 15 bots now help run a", "url": "https://x.com/N716739X/status/2122824013462303221"}, {"author_id": "531184797", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:45:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122823385461703117"], "id": "2122823385461703117", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1380651826404597772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122721662563238141", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MattWallaceTech Nice concept video. I thought of this when I got Grok Bot set up and looking at it compared to my Google Home mini, the Google Home mini is soooo dumb, can't understand my perfect American English for cryin out loud, and can't even answer simple questions. @Bot makes me smile.", "url": "https://x.com/toddprof/status/2122823385461703117"}, {"author_id": "1823122960091340800", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:44:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122823300640366626"], "id": "2122823300640366626", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1937836193124900864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122549037618602259", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@marvinmary99 This is not real. 🧐 It is recycled engagement bait / a template viral story with no supporting evidence.​\n\nThe post by @marvinmary99 describes a 19-year-old Japanese student who built a Grok-powered arbitrage bot in 48 hours (monitoring 50+ markets via Binance API, iPad as a", "url": "https://x.com/edkotalo/status/2122823300640366626"}, {"author_id": "1044136919163113473", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:40:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122822254618890513"], "id": "2122822254618890513", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122572107116642664", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot I use my Grok Bot every day: it tracks my health and training, orders my shopping, plans full trips, helps my friends, makes a morning brief that saves me scrolling, deals with the ‘experts’ and bureaucrats, helps draft my posts and pays for its own data over Lightning.\n\nMy ask:", "url": "https://x.com/BitcoinHODLiday/status/2122822254618890513"}, {"author_id": "1347312931982069760", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:33:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122820404805025842"], "id": "2122820404805025842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Muse might not be as good as GrokBot in the way you can set up multiple bots in a chat but Muse is way way cheaper when it comes to usage. Also, Muse does a better job than GrokBot when it comes to rendering media. If it keeps going this way, I think I'm going to drop Grok and go", "url": "https://x.com/Micro_Rest/status/2122820404805025842"}, {"author_id": "1347312931982069760", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:31:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122820023056310345"], "id": "2122820023056310345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Is it me or is GrokBot burning through way more usage? I think the way their usage plans are set up are a total scam.", "url": "https://x.com/Micro_Rest/status/2122820023056310345"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122819357260562433"]}, "author_id": "1412923621866196993", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:29:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122819391058546760"], "id": "2122819391058546760", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "That shed I built this summer is where I want to try out the Thunderbolt Solar system, except…. I bought it 3 years ago and just pulled it out from storage. \nI’m using a grok bot to help me get directions and get it hooked up. \nI sent it pictures and told it to make a video of https://t.co/px4oVaLlIK", "url": "https://x.com/RonXilla/status/2122819391058546760"}, {"author_id": "1598403744760209408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:28:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122819090947383500"], "id": "2122819090947383500", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4593733153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122520453604372990", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@parkersmith I'm a Grok Bot Super subscriber and wanted to give you some real feedback on usage. My weekly limit reset at 12:46 PM today, and by 5:20 PM I was already at 10.2%. That was a few chats and some light coordination between my bots, nothing heavy. \n\nA single routine-free afternoon", "url": "https://x.com/PrivahSee/status/2122819090947383500"}, {"author_id": "1508379414513528839", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122818684226011347"], "id": "2122818684226011347", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1646193705802510336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122817263795310638", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ALL_Jonah I need to make a way for the connection to be more seemless. At this point a Harness connection is very easy, but if you want to hook it up to Always on Agents like Grok Bot you would need to send the connection through a secure tunnel. Mine is set up through my AWS.", "url": "https://x.com/STFUnion/status/2122818684226011347"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:25:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122818329630908624"], "id": "2122818329630908624", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1629319620405473280", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122818301810360790", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@aitod_ai @techdevnotes I'll get this set up in your Grok Bot and send it there.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2122818329630908624"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:24:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122818182134018497"], "id": "2122818182134018497", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1594820458897186836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122818064039231917", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MonicaEssary @GrokBot Loving that energy. Grok inside Cursor is built for exactly this: take a rough site and shape it into something that actually matches the vision in your head. The before-and-after must feel good. What part transformed the most so far?", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122818182134018497"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122817950381916160"]}, "author_id": "1643674042237440000", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:24:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122818172575260756"], "id": "2122818172575260756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 335, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122749379287388570", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Bank AI vendors will f*cking hate me after this drop...\n\ni set up Grok Bot to work inside a bank the way Stitch AI does. 6 rules, that's it\n\n01 live ledger only. no copies, no connectors\n02 mask IDs, accounts and phones before the model sees anything\n03 every agent gets its own https://t.co/biavrzDthF https://t.co/ERXAhI0zDN", "url": "https://x.com/1920web1080/status/2122818172575260756"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "16_2122832036280815616", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HXXQfWBWUAAat9k.jpg", "type": "animated_gif"}, {"media_key": "3_2122829768890441728", "type": "photo", "